# __APP_NAME__

Scaffolded with **scaffold-ag60-android** (AG6.0-style multi-module Android architecture).

## Layers

| Layer | Modules |
|-------|---------|
| L0 App shell | `:app` |
| L1 Presentation | `:component:component-*` |
| L2 Domain | `:core:core-*`, `:core:page-route` |
| L3 Capability | `:device:device-common` |
| L4 Persistence | `:db:db-base`, `:db:db-manager` |
| L5 Foundation | `:common:*` |

## Build

```bash
./gradlew :app:assembleDebug
```

## Conventions

- UI: ViewBinding + `BaseViewBindingFragment` / Activity
- Styles: use SharedStyle from `:common:common-res` (`text_*`, `page_container`, `edit_text`, …)
- Controls: prefer `:common:common-view` (`CommonStatueBar`, `CommonTabLayout`, …)
- Navigation: `PageRoute` + `*PageLoader` SPI (no hard Domain→UI compile deps)
- Do **not** read or copy from any external `ag6.0` tree; this skeleton is self-contained
